# Floor transitive/build tools above pip-audit advisories
msgpack>=1.2.1

# pip is deliberately not listed here. It is the installer, not an application
# dependency, and `pip-compile` treats it as unsafe-to-pin: any regeneration
# without --allow-unsafe drops it from the lockfile, which is exactly what
# Dependabot does on every bump. Listing it here made the alignment check fail
# on every Dependabot pull request. Its floor is enforced in CI instead, and
# the installed environment is audited so the advisory is still caught.
